+# STORY-871 — Test Design (Phase 7)
+
+## Overview
+
+| Field | Value |
+|-------|-------|
+| Story | STORY-871: Dashboard History tab reads from v2 terminal lane |
+| Phase | 7 — Test Design (RED state) |
+| Scope | Small |
+| Author | Morris (Dan dispatch) |
+| Date | 2026-05-04 |
+
+## What We're Testing
+
+The dashboard History tab currently reads from `/api/dispatch/history` (v1), which reads
+`dispatch_items`. The v2 poller never writes to `dispatch_items`, so 19+ completions are
+invisible. This story adds `GET /api/dispatch/v2/history` that reads from
+`dispatch_state_current JOIN dispatch_jobs WHERE lane='terminal'`, unions pre-cutover v1
+rows, and swaps the frontend hook URL.
+
+## Test Files
+
+| File | Tests | Purpose |
+|------|-------|---------|
+| `tests/ops_console/test_dispatch_v2_history.py` | 11 | Backend route + service tests |
+| `frontend/src/__tests__/useDispatchHistory.test.ts` | 1 | Frontend hook URL assertion (existing file) |
+| `frontend/src/hooks/__tests__/useDispatchQueue.test.ts` | 3 | Hook URL assertion + pagination params (AC-9) |
+| `frontend/e2e/dispatch-history-v2.spec.ts` | 2 | Playwright: History tab renders completed rows (AC-10) |
+
+## Backend Test Cases (`test_dispatch_v2_history.py`)
+
+### T1 — Empty case
+**Verify:** `GET /api/dispatch/v2/history` returns `{items: [], total: 0, limit: 50, offset: 0, fetched_at: <ISO>}` when the terminal lane is empty and no v1 rows exist.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404 (not registered yet).
+
+### T2 — State mapping (completed)
+**Verify:** Row with `state='completed'` maps to `DispatchItem.status='completed'`.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T3 — State mapping (cancelled, dead_letter)
+**Verify:** Rows with `state='cancelled'` and `state='dead_letter'` both map to `status='cancelled'`.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T4 — State mapping (failed)
+**Verify:** Row with `state='failed'` maps to `status='failed'`.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T5 — Field population
+**Verify:** A fixture row with `pr_number=311`, `enqueued_by='dan'`, `leased_by='derrick'`
+produces a response item with those fields populated plus `completed_at` from the terminal event.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T6 — Status filter
+**Verify:** With 3 fixture rows (completed/failed/cancelled):
+- `?status=completed` returns 1 row
+- `?status=failed` returns 1 row
+- `?status=cancelled` returns 1 row
+- no filter returns 3 rows
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T7 — Pagination (limit/offset/total)
+**Verify:** With 25 fixture rows, `?limit=10&offset=10` returns rows 11–20, `total=25`.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T8 — Limit cap
+**Verify:** `?limit=500` is silently capped at 200 (endpoint param capped by FastAPI).
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T9 — v1/v2 union at cutover
+**Verify:** Fixture includes one v1 row with `updated_at='2026-05-02T10:00:00Z'` (pre-cutover)
+and one v2 row. Default request returns both. A post-cutover v1 row (`updated_at='2026-05-04T10:00:00Z'`)
+is excluded from the union.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+### T10 — v1 failure degrades gracefully
+**Verify:** When the v1 `dispatch_items` query raises an exception, the endpoint still
+returns v2 rows (200 OK) and logs ERROR. Never returns 5xx due to v1 failure alone.
+**RED trigger:** Endpoint returns 404.
+
+## Frontend Hook Test (`useDispatchHistory.test.ts`)
+
+### FE-T1 — Hook calls v2 URL
+**Verify:** `useDispatchHistory(0, 20)` calls `api.get` with the path
+`/api/dispatch/v2/history?limit=20&offset=0`.
+**RED trigger:** Hook currently calls `/api/dispatch/history?...` (v1 path).
+
+## Playwright Spec (`e2e/dispatch-history-v2.spec.ts`)
+
+### E2E-T1 — History tab shows completed rows
+**Verify:**
+1. Navigate to `/`
+2. Mock `GET /api/dispatch/v2/history` with one completed item (pr_number=311)
+3. Click History tab
+4. Assert ≥1 row with `status=completed` renders
+5. Assert PR number cell shows "311" (not "NaN" or empty)
+6. Assert `completed_at` timestamp renders without "NaN"
+7. Screenshot captured
+**RED trigger:** Mock intercepts `/api/dispatch/v2/history` but the hook sends requests to
+`/api/dispatch/history` (v1), so the v2 mock is never hit; the History tab renders no rows.
+
+## State Mapping Table
+
+| v2 `state` | `DispatchItem.status` |
+|------------|----------------------|
+| `completed` | `completed` |
+| `cancelled` | `cancelled` |
+| `dead_letter` | `cancelled` |
+| `failed` | `failed` |
+
+## Derived Fields
+
+| `DispatchItem` field | Source |
+|---------------------|--------|
+| `claimed_by` | Most-recent `leased` event's `event_data->>'actor'` from `dispatch_v2_events`; fallback to `dispatch_state_current.leased_by` |
+| `completed_at` | `created_at` of the `accepted` event in `dispatch_v2_events` |
+| `cancelled_at` | `created_at` of the `cancelled` or `dead_lettered` event |
+| `pr_number` | `dispatch_jobs.pr_number` |
+| `enqueued_by` | `dispatch_jobs.enqueued_by` |
+| `repo` | `dispatch_jobs.repo` |
+| `story_id` | `dispatch_jobs.story_id` |
+| `title` | `dispatch_jobs.title` |
+| `scope` | `dispatch_jobs.scope` |
+
+## v1 Union Logic
+
+- Query v1 `dispatch_items WHERE updated_at < V2_HISTORY_CUTOVER_TS` (default `'2026-05-03T00:00:00Z'`)
+- If v1 query fails: log ERROR, continue with v2 rows only (AC-12 graceful degradation)
+- Merge results in Python, sort combined list by `updated_at DESC`
+- Pagination and `total` count operate on the unified result
+
+## Performance Targets
+
+- p95 < 200ms for limit=50
+- ≤ 3 queries per request (v2 select + v2 count/total + v1 union)
+
+## RED State Confirmation Plan
+
+Before Phase 8 implementation, run:
+
+```bash
+# Backend — expect all FAILED (404 because endpoint doesn't exist)
+pytest tests/ops_console/test_dispatch_v2_history.py -v
+
+# Frontend hook — expect FAILED (calls v1 URL, assertion expects v2 URL)  
+pnpm --filter frontend test src/__tests__/useDispatchHistory.test.ts
+
+# Playwright — expect FAILED (v2 mock never hit, History tab empty)
+pnpm --filter frontend playwright test e2e/dispatch-history-v2.spec.ts
+```
+
+All must be RED before Phase 8 begins.
