+"""STORY-871: Phase 7 RED tests — GET /api/dispatch/v2/history endpoint.
+
+These tests are written BEFORE implementation so they fail with 404 (endpoint
+not registered).  Once Phase 8 adds the route and service method every test
+must turn GREEN.
+
+Test cases:
+    T1  empty case — returns empty DispatchHistoryResponse shape
+    T2  state mapping completed → "completed"
+    T3  state mapping cancelled / dead_letter → "cancelled"
+    T4  state mapping failed → "failed"
+    T5  field population (pr_number, enqueued_by, claimed_by, completed_at)
+    T6  status filter (?status=completed|failed|cancelled)
+    T7  pagination (limit/offset/total)
+    T8  limit cap (?limit=500 silently → 200)
+    T9  v1/v2 union at cutover timestamp
+    T10 v1 failure degrades gracefully — still returns v2 rows
